[[0,2751589,0,1,0,1,"2018-09-28T16:20:16","WitnesstheSalt","",[],"","Scientists accidentally blow the DOOR off their laboratory","https://www.dailymail.co.uk/sciencetech/article-6218723/Scientists-accidentally-blow-DOOR-laboratory.html","technology"],[1,14135645,0,0,0,0,"2018-09-28T16:20:55","WitnesstheSalt","",[],"<p>Deleted the previous Archive link to Vice after finding a link that wasn't quite as bad as Vice.</p>"],[1,14139020,0,0,0,0,"2018-09-28T18:44:25","NassTee","",[],"<p>Same thing happened to me. I was totally doing an experiment, not making meth.</p>"],[2,14139218,14139020,0,0,0,"2018-09-28T18:52:00","WitnesstheSalt","",[],"<p><a href=\"https://invidio.us/watch?v=itguKA1wywQ\">Oh shit I just done doxxed you!</a></p>"],[3,14140292,14139218,0,0,0,"2018-09-28T19:34:45","NassTee","",[],"<p>You got me. I would have gotten away with it, too, if it weren't for those pesky Walmart employees.</p>"],[1,14139283,0,0,0,0,"2018-09-28T18:54:46","Plavonica","",[],"<p>You know what? I was just thinking on something like this today. What sort of science and experimentation do you get when shit starts exploding, burning, arcing/sparking, and otherwise does entertaining stuff? The good sort.</p>\n<p>&quot;Don't do this.&quot;</p>\n<p>&quot;Why?&quot;</p>\n<p>&quot;It explodes.&quot;</p>\n<p>The other sort, where nothing happens, nobody is interested, much of it is paid-for by interested mega-corps? Questionable science.</p>\n<p>&quot;Don't do this.&quot;</p>\n<p>&quot;Why?&quot;</p>\n<p>&quot;Because.&quot;</p>\n<p>&quot;What?&quot;</p>\n<p>&quot;Drink Coke.&quot;</p>"]]
