[[0,2751598,0,2,0,2,"2018-09-28T16:23:05","TheBuddha","",[],"<p>I have to leave for the show at about 15:30. Ol' Buddha has to perform tonight.</p>\n<p>Now, if I leave early - I can drive at ½ the speed limit.</p>\n<p>They're mostly twisty roads. People can't really easily pass me!</p>\n<p>That's right...</p>\n<p>The cars will line up behind me and I can make my own damned parade! There will be merry horn tootling and, if I drink enough, I might even get some sirens!</p>\n<p>Damned right. I now have nearly infinite parades and this world is going to have some justice in it. </p>\n<p>Yup... You're seeing genius at work, people. This is <em>exactly</em> why I'm a national fucking treasure!</p>","So... I've been thinking...","","SoapboxBanhammer"],[1,14135754,0,0,0,0,"2018-09-28T16:26:35","GranimalSnake","",[],"<p>Bahahaha holy shit... have a good show man. Drive extra slow for me... maybe throw a wave out the window.</p>"],[2,14135836,14135754,0,0,0,"2018-09-28T16:30:53","TheBuddha","",[],"<p>I am gonna cause irreparable hearing loss, crack bad jokes, and play them the merry tunes of my people!</p>\n<p>I'm pretty sure that means I'm gonna have a good show! Thanks! I am pretty sure... I've even reserved hotel rooms! I still need to stop and pick up foodstuffs for the band and swear at a few people.</p>\n<p>My next mission is to figure out how to get people to throw bits of paper at me. I really kinda want a ticker-tape parade. </p>\n<p>Wait... No...</p>\n<p>That's woefully inaccurate.</p>\n<p>I really fucking <em>deserve</em> a ticker-tape parade.</p>"],[1,14136461,0,0,0,0,"2018-09-28T17:01:41","AzureFlameKite","",[],"<p>...\\̶̨̧̨̧̡̢̧̧̨̧̛̰͙͍̩̥̱͉̬͔̻̝͓̯͉̰̙̝̳͖͖̱͔̖̘̙̠͙̞͈̥̦͙̻͔͉̦̙̭̻̳͚̝̞͚̯͓̰̮͎̬̞͕̥̺̮͔͇̙̭̲͇͓͉̯̳̫̱̭̣̯̜̪̲͓̰͓̘̣̝̘̰̬̩̲̮͗̄͂̆̍̉̽̐͊͌͊̈̈́͒̐͗̋̀̀̈́͌͗̿̌͒̈́̀̌͂̃͊̅̿̑̽̉̈́͐̌̂̓̽̈̏̆̓̐͋̃̓͆̅͊̋̾͊̃̽͗̒͋̽͐̔̓͆̄̽͊̊̅̃̏̓̈́̾͒̅̾͊͐̇͗̑̈̀̈́̇̚̕̕͜͜͜͠͠͝͝͝͝͠͝ͅͅ..\\̵̧̧̨̡̡̧̡̛̛̛̛̛͓̻͉͙̘͉̻̩͚͇̲͙͇͔̩̲͉̘͚̹̦͈͇̼̹̼̤̖̟̤̹͚̭͕̝̤̝̞̟̻̺̺͈̯̤̫͎̝͕̘͎̩͔͎͙̪̼͕̮̜̤̱̙̦͖̦̣͍̭͙̹̗̯̺̱̣͈̘͓̗̖̜̩̠̦͕̺̻̩͊͛̋̇͒̽̏̀͋̽̆̀̏͐͛̌͂̊̍͐̒́̉̒̒̑̀͊̆̈́̈̈́̐͌̐͛̇͛̈́̈́̌̈͆̿̀̈́͂̒́̀̿̃̋̑̌̊̓̓̀̽̍̋̔͒̈́̃͋́̊̊͗͆̆̆́̀̈́́̀̓̇̿̓̕̕̚̚̚͜͜͜͠͝͝͠͝͝͝ͅ.\\̵̧̡̡̡̨̨̛̛͔̜̫̺̺̖̲̠̼͚̺͙͇̣͚̘̯̣̰̼̠̹̻͈̩̠͍͙̳̲̤̪̭͕̭̞̯͕͇̦͎̟̼̫͖̼̫͍͖̪̱̮̝̟͖͙̭̮̠̰͕̺̣͎̬̘̳͈̙͙͖̞̙̥̠̠̹̦̫̖̮͉̰͔̉̔̇͑̊̋̏̌̔̈̎͌̓̃͛̏̾̓́͗̋̐͋̀͐̆̒̅̇͑̊̌̈̒͒̐͂̂̍̈́̾̒̋̓͋̇̄̒̾̎̀̑̂̐̏̽́͛̿̂̊̍̆̓̌͊͐̈́̐̓͌́͒͆͗̆͛̈́͆̔̅̏͗̕̚͘̕͜͜͜͜͜͜͜͠͠͠͠͝͠͝͝͠͝͝ͅͅͅ\\̵̨̧̧̡̡̧̧̢̨̨̢̨̡̛̠̮͔̝͉͈͇̰̫̰͎̭̞͉̟̱̜̣̺͙̯̪͔͔̤͓͙͙̭̭̜̮͙̞̦̪̗̣̞͚͙̳̫̱̭̺͕̗̺̤͍̺̹͔̯̺̩̝͈͍̣̱̝͚̞̲̰̹͎̗̦̱̞͍̻̦͓͇̗̙̮̉̑̌͌̐͌͛̅̌̎̈́̾̑̊̀̽͆̈͑̍̏̓͌̿̂́͌͋́͊̀͌̌̈́̓̅̈́̀́̈́̊̇̊̂͛̇̐̈́͋͊͋͆̒͗̒̓̈́̈́̉̐̄͂̀̀̑̍͋͗͊̓͆̈́̅͒͊̅̏͂̊͛͛̍̂̄͂̔̆́̓̚͘͘̕̚̚͜͜͜͜͝͠͝͝ͅͅ...\\̸̨̨̢̢̢̧̡̧̦̦̳̗͎̭͓͙͉̣̺͚̩̝̫͓̲͕̹̼̺̯̘̝̥̩̞̰̞̜̗͇̣̜͈̯̬̱̟̩̙̰̭̺̙̮͇̖̼̬͚̞̤̙̙̖͇̙͚͕̰͕͔̞̱̻̗̘̭̲͖̩͓̟̘͕͍̗͖̣͈̘̰̼̦̘̹̲́̃̆̍̓̆͑͗͌͗̀̀̐̊̍̆̔͋́͑̎̏̋̀̀̈́̌̉́̽̊̀̒͋̎̀̔̉̓͒̎͂͑̏̍͊̉̏́̍̒͂̑̋̿̂̔͑̀̐̐̅̈̉̉̊̓̑̽̎́̌͆̒̀̄̅͊̓̒͊͗͂̓́͋̓͂͘͘͘͘̚̕̚͘͜͜͝͝͠͝ͅͅ......\\̶̨̧̨̢̧̢̧̨̛̛̛͍͙͚̘͙̬̭̪͙͇̯̺͈͕̖̝̠̗̙̣̘͈̱̞̺̖̞̘͍̫̙̫̝̥̦̥͍͚̼̹̤̲̲͈͚̣͎̝͙̠̤̘̼͇̯̺̜͙̖̯̯͙͔̳̳̯̜̝͉̪̮͓̺͓̠͙͓̦̻̺̟͓̺̘̮̝̪̙̇̎̄̏͒̽̆̂͊̓̈̽͂͆̍͒́͛̂̐̀̉̏̄̄́̐̎̏̾̿̈́̋́͊̓̈͂̃͆̈́̾̂̔̾͋͗̓̉̀͋̒͒̀̑̈̏̉̈̽̔͌̈̊́͛́͋̋͑̓̇̓̾͛͗̇̂̒͒̊̊̅̿͘̚̚̕̕̕͜͜͝͠͠͝͝͝͝ͅͅ......\\̴̢̨̢̢̧̡̧̛̛̰̮͓͈̭͎̝̻͈̼̖̥͔͇̭̰̖̻͓̰̪͖̝̮̣̲͓̝̹̯̗̳̪̳͇͓̞͖̻͔̖̦̯̙̫͚̬̲̣̥̟͙͍͇͈̦̩͍̥̖̰̦̖͍̲͖̝̭̠͉̻̤̞̭̲̼̺̱̫̼͔̦̭̙͚̮̘͓̲̭̲̰̒̀̽̄̽̏̽̌̿̿͆̆̊̅̾́̄̏̋̓͑̓͆͌̇̈͆̍̓̇͆̿̇͊̊̉̀̋̔̑̅̈̇͊͗͒͂̅̈́̒̏̋̍͗̿̐̈́̄̀́̇̽̓̔͆̈́́̆̉̋́̋̈́̑͆̒̈͒̋͌̀̿́̀͘̚̕̚͘͠͝͠͠͝͠͝͝͝ͅ.\\̸̢̡̢̡̨̢̨̛̛̛̛̖̦̻̳̣̱̺̭̙͕̫̗̙̱̱̣̹͓̦͖̯͖͙̣̫͎̯̠̙̗̱̥͍͇̱̖̦̭̼̰͔͉̙̘͓̥͖̖͚̻̩̭̺͙͇̩̬͈̹̜̥͇̜̮̥͚͈̻̣̻̣̥̩̲̤̥̲͖̩̩̪͍̹̹͎͙͈͈̋̾̃̍̏̀̽̓́̒̊̑̐̿́̊́̓̈́͗̍̑͑̏̂̀̑̑̀̒̀̌̽͆͒̍̾̽̎́̋̓̈̃̓̋͂̎̂̄͗̀̊͛̒͐̅̇͒͊͛̿͗̈́͆̇̉͒̿̀͛͌̌̓́̉̋̍͘̕͘͘̕̚̚͘̕̕͘̚͜͜͜͠͝͠͝͠͝ͅͅ.\\̸̧̡̧̛̛̜̭̩͚̟̥̬̩͈̹̯̱̯̲͖̱͖̮̥̥̙̠̺̮̜͇̣̘̥͙̲̲̞̯͈̝̼̺͕̥̰͔̩̩̘͈͚̥̣͓̬͔̦̰̜͍̯̻̮̞͔͉̩̱̯̯̯̱͔͍̲͔̪̭͔̣̻͓̰̖̞̣͓̭͕̞̠̯͚̩͖̫̔͌̃̐̽̿͆̌̿́̋̉͐̀̌̇́̆̎͑̒̊̐̀͂̉̊̈͐̋̓͛̈́̆͑̓̀͂͑́͆̓̏͋̌̂̎͑̐̄̓̐͗̉̔̆̎̒͗̽̐̈́̅̍̑̿̌̌̑̒̈́̓͑̆̓̓͆͌̃̓̄̋́͌͊͂̎̕̕̚̚̚̕͜͜͜͜͜͝͠͝͝͠..\\̶̧̡̨̡̧̢̛̛̛̛͙̱͍̮̫̱͈̗̦̗̭̲̙͙͉̱̪̥͔̰͚͚̣̰̳̳͔̟͈͕͎̤̯̱͉͙̮͉̠̻̻̲͇̤̹͇͓̳̹͇̟̘̹̣͍̥͇̖̖̗͍͓̻̪̦͉̱̺͇̘̩̺͖̫̲̼̺̘͍̫͓̜͖̪̥̪̼̰͈͖̐̌̋̆̽̐̉̓̾̎̉̋͋̌̉͌̓̾͆͑̈͐̍͂̈́̽̈́̌͋͋̒͑̑͌̐̆̌̊̄̿͂͒͗̃̑͐́̽̓͆͗͂̍̐̈́̑̋̌̎̇͋̅͐̏̋̄͆̇͒̋͛̒̌̏̉͌̐̓̇͌͐̐̚͘̚̕̕͜͝͝͝͠͝͝͝͠͠ͅͅͅ.\\̸̢̢̧̨̡̧̨̨̛͎̳̜͕͕̞͈̝̬̻̰̟̘̮̞̯͔̗̙͙̬̼̪̰͖͈̣̖̩̰̠̣̤̺̼̖̹͔͖̝̗̫̯̝̳̻̬̟̳̮̤͇̳͙̲̮͖͍͓͎͇͇̱̱͚͈͖̬͉̬̺̭̱͈̭̟͕̰̥̫̘̗̩̤̲̝̩̩̩̟̄̉̈́̒̿̿̉̾̏̈́̔̂́̌̃̈́̈͆͑͑̃͆͐̆̌̈́̈̋̏̒̆́͌͋̄͌̌̔̐͛̃͂̓̇̅̀̎̑͒͛̔̃͐̈̏͌͒̅̿͊̍̋̽̈́̉́̀̇̌̔̈̃́͋̎̌̓̅́̐̀̇̀̈́͘̚̚̕͘͘͜͠͠͝͝͝͠͝͝͝ͅ......\\̷̛̛̛̛̛͒̏̿̆͒͊̾̓̓̈́̅̐̔̓̉͊͂̔̈̎̿́͗̂͂̈́̉̾̂̌̈̆͌̍̿͆̃̒͊͐̓̈́͑́͑̎̌̈̾̏́̔̈́̈́͆̓̏̈́͒̐̔͊̀̀̐̈́́͆̉͊͐̚̕̚͘̕͘͝͝͝͝